HB0168 Cultivated meat-prohibition.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Eklund, Banks, Brady and Davis and
Senator(s) Crago and Driskill
AN ACT relating to public health and safety; prohibiting the manufacture, sale
and distribution of cultivated meat for human consumption; providing
definitions; providing penalties; and providing for effective dates.
